    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a wandering duelist, sworn to protect a nobleman whose love affair has placed him in grave danger. Your duty is clear\u2014defend your charge and navigate the treacherous waters of courtly intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But honor and survival are rarely so simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fencing instructor, you must balance your daily life between earning a living, training students, and honing your skills. Teach noblemen who see swordplay as a game, take on private lessons to keep food on the table, and perhaps even guide your young prot\u00e9g\u00e9, Anna, as she desperately seeks to escape her life of a simple farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is inspired by the techniques of Joachim Meyer, a real 16th-century fencing master, with a complex, hard to master system that rewards  tactical thinking and learning the mechanics. Every duel is a deadly dance where one or two strikes may decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uphold your duty, pursue your own ambitions, or be swallowed by the chaos of love and egos?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a wandering duelist, sworn to protect a nobleman whose love affair has placed him in grave danger. Your duty is clear\u2014defend your charge and navigate the treacherous waters of courtly intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But honor and survival are rarely so simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fencing instructor, you must balance your daily life between earning a living, training students, and honing your skills. Teach noblemen who see swordplay as a game, take on private lessons to keep food on the table, and perhaps even guide your young prot\u00e9g\u00e9, Anna, as she desperately seeks to escape her life of a simple farmer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is inspired by the techniques of Joachim Meyer, a real 16th-century fencing master, with a complex, hard to master system that rewards  tactical thinking and learning the mechanics. Every duel is a deadly dance where one or two strikes may decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uphold your duty, pursue your own ambitions, or be swallowed by the chaos of love and egos?</p>",
    "short_description": "Play the role and daily life of a wandering duelist hired to protect a nobleman embroiled in a dangerous affair. Navigate both deadly duels and delicate social situations in this gripping visual novel/RPG with realistic swordplay inspired by period fencing manuals.",
